 "answer": "化简得 \\(9a+7\\)，当 \\(a=-1\\) 时，原式 \\(=-2\\)。",
 "methodPoints": [],
 "solution": "\\((2a+1)^{2}=4a^{2}+4a+1\\)，\\((a-2)(4a+3)=4a^{2}+3a-8a-6=4a^{2}-5a-6\\)。\n原式 \\(=4a^{2}+4a+1-4a^{2}+5a+6=9a+7\\)。\n\\(a=-1\\) 时，原式 \\(=-9+7=-2\\)。",
 "explanation": {
  "idea": "先展开合并，最后代值。",
  "hints": [
   "\\((2a+1)^{2}\\) 用哪个公式？"
  ],
  "steps": [
